{"4192180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tileland", "steam_appid": 4192180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own strategy with the dice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/a4c901647a26cd41bb55d6a556ec7077.poster.avif?t=1781738132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/a4c901647a26cd41bb55d6a556ec7077.webm?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/a4c901647a26cd41bb55d6a556ec7077.mp4?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you going to move? Are you going to act?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each die carries a different effect — attack an enemy, strengthen a tile, or hold your ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The numbers you pick shape your entire turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think carefully. Every choice matters.<br><br><strong>Make a powerful board by strengthening the tiles</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/3971dd0e7759463f4426249d202b4ff0.poster.avif?t=1781738132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/3971dd0e7759463f4426249d202b4ff0.webm?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/3971dd0e7759463f4426249d202b4ff0.mp4?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Tiles get more and more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you use a tile, it gains experience. Level it up to unlock stronger effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix attack, defense, and healing tiles to build a board that fits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your board is your weapon — make it yours.<br><br><strong>Choose your path wisely</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/4480e009e9fee9e12381208e55664528.poster.avif?t=1781738132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/4480e009e9fee9e12381208e55664528.webm?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/4480e009e9fee9e12381208e55664528.mp4?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every run begins with a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a branching map filled with enemies, elite encounters, shops, blacksmiths, and camps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same — the path you take shapes the warrior you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you fight every enemy to grow stronger, or play it safe and stock up on potions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey is yours to decide.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own strategy with the dice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/a4c901647a26cd41bb55d6a556ec7077.poster.avif?t=1781738132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/a4c901647a26cd41bb55d6a556ec7077.webm?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/a4c901647a26cd41bb55d6a556ec7077.mp4?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you going to move? Are you going to act?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each die carries a different effect — attack an enemy, strengthen a tile, or hold your ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The numbers you pick shape your entire turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think carefully. Every choice matters.<br><br><strong>Make a powerful board by strengthening the tiles</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/3971dd0e7759463f4426249d202b4ff0.poster.avif?t=1781738132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/3971dd0e7759463f4426249d202b4ff0.webm?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/3971dd0e7759463f4426249d202b4ff0.mp4?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Tiles get more and more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you use a tile, it gains experience. Level it up to unlock stronger effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix attack, defense, and healing tiles to build a board that fits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your board is your weapon — make it yours.<br><br><strong>Choose your path wisely</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/4480e009e9fee9e12381208e55664528.poster.avif?t=1781738132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/4480e009e9fee9e12381208e55664528.webm?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/extras/4480e009e9fee9e12381208e55664528.mp4?t=1781738132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every run begins with a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a branching map filled with enemies, elite encounters, shops, blacksmiths, and camps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same — the path you take shapes the warrior you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you fight every enemy to grow stronger, or play it safe and stock up on potions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey is yours to decide.</p>", "short_description": "Tileland is a turn-based roguelike where every dice roll shapes your fate. Traverse enchanted tiles, upgrade your arsenal, wield powerful runes and potions, and outmaneuver deadly enemies in a world where strategy meets chance.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/0d3821f35c7b48aaa95a62fdfe2fe6a8950a097a/header.jpg?t=1781738132", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/46347e71c04de7eaf1a13a2114a66391eed83e00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781738132", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192180/46347e71c04de7eaf1a13a2114a66391eed83e00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781738132", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AM